# <Feature> Cache Policy

Use this for features with non-obvious freshness, polling, prefetching, or
optimistic update behavior.

| Query | Key | staleTime | gcTime | Refetch/polling | Why |
|---|---|---:|---:|---|---|
| Domain detail | `QK.domain.detail(id)` | `30_000` | repo default | none | Normal detail screen; mutation invalidation keeps it fresh. |
| Domain reference data | `QK.domain.reference()` | `300_000` | repo default | none | Low volatility catalog data. |

Decision checklist:

- Volatile workflow state: prefer `10_000` to `30_000`.
- Normal list/detail screens: prefer `30_000` to `60_000`.
- Reference/catalog data: prefer around `300_000`.
- Use `Infinity` only for data that changes on login/session boundary.
- Do not use `"static"` unless manual invalidation must be ignored.
- Add polling only for live-ish surfaces and document the interval rationale.
